abstract: "Normal, gamma, chi-squared and beta cumulative distribution functions and the error and gamma functions behind them, in double precision for JavaScript (Node.js), validated row by row against arbitrary-precision references (mpmath, 70 digits) under per-region tolerances fixed before the code was written."
